            "review_title": "Review at Oak Smokehouse Sai Gon",
            "review_text": "Clarisse B\n15 contributions\n0\nUnforgettable experience\nAug 2024 • Family\nThe place is amazing! The roof top offers a magnificent view of HCMC by night and offers a very pleasant open environment.\nWe tasted quality food worthy of a gastronomy.\nThe welcome for our daughter's birthday was exceptional: decoration, atmosphere and souvenir shots as a gift.\nI highly recommend and invite you to discover the Oak Smokehouse\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten August 6, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
