            "review_title": "Review at Oak Smokehouse Sai Gon",
            "review_text": "Makayla Brownlow\nGin Gin, Australia3 contributions\n0\nDelicious food, thoughtful decoration, cozy space, chill music.\nNov 2023 • Couples\nOne of the restaurants in Saigon with some real good food. Been there a few times and never disappoints. Most of the food is well thought out and has some element of the wood fire in it. Good wine selection at reasonable prices and the service is always pleasant. Well done Oak Smokehouse team!\nValue\nService\nWritten November 24, 2023",
