            "review_title": "Review at Oak Smokehouse Sai Gon",
            "review_text": "Anjali Hand\nVancouver, Canada4 contributions\n0\nDelicious food.\nNov 2023 • Couples\nVery satisfied with the food and service! You need to make a reservation as this is a busy place. The waiter was able to answer in detail all my questions about the menu, including the grams of meat used to prepare a dish. The smoked salmon risotto was cheesy and comforting. The dishes were creative and had many complementary elements in terms of flavor and texture. The environment is a large open space with the dining room and kitchen visible from each other. Will definitely come back.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten November 23, 2023",
