            "review_title": "Review at Oak Smokehouse Sai Gon",
            "review_text": "Robert S\n1 contribution\n1\nAmazing smokehouse HCMC D1\nNov 2023 • Friends\nThis is an AMAZING venue. When I first walked in the view from the balcony was breathtaking. The staff immediately took care of me and my friend. We ordered some smoked beef, steak and the signature dish of salmon - it was really good and i also really enjoyed their home made bbq sauce and slaw. I spoke to the Manager who mentioned they smoke the meat with oak chips - and the flavour is crazy good. I highly recommend this place for any occasion- the staff will ensure you have everything you need and the food is to die for.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 7, 2023",
